Changed the validation framework from vuelidate to vee-validate and added validation for SIN Number.
Reasons why the validation framework was changed to vee-validate:

- Better documentation;
- Huge amount of contributors in comparison with vuelidate; 
- Developed in Typescript;
- Seems to be easier to find help in forums and etc. for vee-validate;
- Also supported as a 3rd party component for Veutify.
